#: ../../source/docs/steering-mode.rst:5 fc693a5cf1ed4adaa690e46dcbbd631f
msgid "Steering Mode"
msgstr "Steering 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/steering-mode.rst:7 21ce342f9684461fa3639e671cb1bf33
msgid ""
"In Steering mode the user's steering stick controls the vehicle's lateral "
"acceleration and the throttle stick controls the vehicle's speed. At a given"
" steering stick percentage, the vehicle will be controlled to try produce a "
"turn with a lateral acceleration of that percentage of the g-force produced "
"by turning in a  :ref:`TURN_RADIUS <TURN_RADIUS>` turn at the current target"
" speed, not to exceed :ref:`ATC_TURN_MAX_G<ATC_TURN_MAX_G>` G's. So for full"
" stick steering inputs, at lower speeds, the turn radius will be "
":ref:`TURN_RADIUS <TURN_RADIUS>`, gradually increasing with speed such that "
":ref:`ATC_TURN_MAX_G<ATC_TURN_MAX_G>` is not exceeded. Once the input "
"returns to neutral, the vehicle will attempt to hold heading, compensating "
"for external influences, ie. \"heading hold\". For ground based vehicles, "
"this attempts to prevent roll-overs or skids."
msgstr ""
"在 Steering "
"模式下，用户的转向摇杆控制车辆的横向加速度，油门摇杆控制车辆速度。在给定转向摇杆百分比下，车辆将被控制以产生该百分比对应横向加速度的转弯，该加速度为在当前目标速度下以"
" :ref:`TURN_RADIUS <TURN_RADIUS>` 转弯时产生的 G 力的百分比，但不超过 "
":ref:`ATC_TURN_MAX_G<ATC_TURN_MAX_G>` G。因此在满杆转向输入下，低速时转弯半径为 "
":ref:`TURN_RADIUS <TURN_RADIUS>`，随速度增加逐渐增大，以不超过 "
":ref:`ATC_TURN_MAX_G<ATC_TURN_MAX_G>` "
"为限。当输入回到中立后，车辆将尝试保持航向，补偿外部干扰，即「保持航向」功能。对于地面车辆，这有助于防止侧翻或侧滑。"

#: ../../source/docs/steering-mode.rst:10 3603f0cadcd741f9b9192158348e391a
msgid ""
"the :ref:`TURN_RADIUS <TURN_RADIUS>` parameter controls the maximum "
"aggressiveness of the turns.  A smaller number results in more aggressive "
"turns.This is the tightest radius that ground vehicles can do, usually at "
"low speed."
msgstr ""
":ref:`TURN_RADIUS <TURN_RADIUS>` "
"参数控制转弯的最大激进程度。数值越小，转弯越激进。这是地面车辆能够实现的最小转弯半径，通常在低速下实现。"

#: ../../source/docs/steering-mode.rst:11 677edf26d9de459a9540ad6b65272126
msgid ""
"the :ref:`ATC_TURN_MAX_G<ATC_TURN_MAX_G>` parameter sets the maximum limit "
"on lateral G's while steering to prevent roll-overs or skids on ground "
"vehicles."
msgstr ":ref:`ATC_TURN_MAX_G<ATC_TURN_MAX_G>` 参数设置转向时的横向 G 限制，以防止地面车辆侧翻或侧滑。"

#: ../../source/docs/steering-mode.rst:12 94b6e68da57f46a48fdd4defa49b42be
msgid ""
"when not moving, skid-steering vehicles will pivot in response to steering "
"input but regular steering-throttle rovers will show almost no steering "
"response."
msgstr "静止时，差速转向车辆将响应转向输入进行原地旋转，而常规转向-油门 Rover 几乎不会有转向响应。"

#: ../../source/docs/steering-mode.rst:13 700ae2d5dd2c41f2999be3ad2b8b11c5
msgid ""
"the top speed is interpolated from the :ref:`CRUISE_THROTTLE "
"<CRUISE_THROTTLE>` and :ref:`CRUISE_SPEED <CRUISE_SPEED>` parameters.  These"
" parameters are described on the :ref:`Tuning Speed and Throttle <rover-"
"tuning-throttle-and-speed>` page."
msgstr ""
"最高速度由 :ref:`CRUISE_THROTTLE <CRUISE_THROTTLE>` 和 :ref:`CRUISE_SPEED "
"<CRUISE_SPEED>` 参数插值得出。这些参数在 :ref:`速度与油门调试 <rover-tuning-throttle-and-"
"speed>` 页面中有详细描述。"

#: ../../source/docs/steering-mode.rst:14 713b8986002b443b8a45e40f5bc54c33
msgid ""
":ref:`Object Avoidance <rover-object-avoidance>` is active in this mode (if "
"configured)."
msgstr "本模式下 :ref:`避障功能 <rover-object-avoidance>` 处于激活状态（如已配置）。"

#: ../../source/docs/steering-mode.rst:15 68467b3d02e049a8ac89c1d45575aa12
msgid ""
"this mode can be used to tune the :ref:`steering rate <rover-tuning-"
"steering-rate>` and :ref:`speed controllers <rover-tuning-throttle-and-"
"speed>` ahead of attempting to tune :ref:`navigation controls <rover-tuning-"
"navigation>`, but using :ref:`Acro Mode<acro-mode>` is preferred to prevent "
"Steering Mode limiting any turn rates."
msgstr ""
"此模式可用于在尝试调试 :ref:`导航控制 <rover-tuning-navigation>` 之前调试 :ref:`转向速率 <rover-"
"tuning-steering-rate>` 和 :ref:`速度控制器 <rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed>`，但首选 "
":ref:`Acro 模式<acro-mode>` 以防止 Steering 模式限制转向速率。"
